(
    title: "Skindiver",
    developer: Some("Bit Corporation"),
    description: Some("An underwater diving game over two stages. First you guide a diver and pick off fish one at a time with your spear for points, while a 60-second oxygen supply counts down at the bottom of the screen — and you must time your rises so a fish is never directly beneath you, or it catches you. Surviving that lets you enter a sunken ship to gather treasure chests, now dodging three sea monsters and the wreck\'s obstacles before your air runs out."),
